{"id":"89109c70f311","path":"/en/university/info/llm/externals/personalised-courses","lang":"en","title":"Personalised language courses","description":"Le facoltà, gli istituti e i servizi dell’Università della Svizzera italiana possono richiedere l’attivazione di corsi linguistici personalizzati, progettati per rispondere alle esigenze specifiche di studenti, dottorandi, ricercatori, docenti e collaboratori. Ogni corso è svilup","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","LLM","Projects"],"image":null,"words":165,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/llm/esterni/corsi-su-misura","en":"/en/university/info/llm/externals/personalised-courses"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"LLM","path":null},{"label":"Projects","path":null},{"label":"Personalised language courses","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The faculties, institutes and services of the Università della Svizzera italiana may request tailor-made language courses designed to meet the specific needs of students, PhD, researchers, faculty members and staff.</p> <p>Each course is developed according to the participants’ learning objectives and language proficiency levels. Courses may focus on the development of general language skills, the acquisition of discipline-specific language, or the enhancement of the language competencies required in academic contexts. The costs of tailor-made courses are borne entirely by the requesting faculty, institute or service.</p> <p>The Modern Languages Laboratory has extensive experience in designing and delivering tailor-made language training programmes. It works closely with the Faculty of Communication, Culture and Society, the Faculty of Economics, the Faculty of Biomedical Sciences, the IRB and IOR research institutes, the University’s Human Resources Service, and the International Relations and Mobility Service, developing targeted training programmes that address the specific needs of different disciplinary, academic and professional contexts.</p> <p>For further information, please contact the <a href=\"mailto:corsi.lingua@usi.ch?subject=Tailored%20language%20courses%20for%20a%20fee\">Laboratory of Modern Languages</a>.</p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Laboratory of Modern Languages","href":"/en/universita/info/llm"},{"label":"Administrative team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/administrative-team"},{"label":"Lecturers team","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/lecturers-team"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/annual-report"},{"label":"LLM key figures","href":"/en/university/info/llm/administration/figures"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/universita/info/llm/italiano/docenti"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/italian/satisfaction-italian-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/italian-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/french/satisfaction-french-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/french-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/german/satisfaction-german-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://www.desk.usi.ch/en/german-language-courses-faq"},{"label":"Courses","href":"/en/university/info/llm/courses"},{"label":"Lecturers","href":"/en/university/info/llm/english/lecturers"},{"label":"Courses satisfaction","href":"/en/university/info/llm/english/satisfaction-english-courses"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"https://ww